/-!
# Source-native M14 urban spatial coordinates

The urban coordinate is generated by the existing periodic route-outage
restoration at the refusal target Payment depth.  Its blocked and restored
branches retain one exact route root occurrence and one exact crossing; they
differ only through the source-generated empty route family versus the
generated route receipt and feasible target edge.

No city name, district label, spatial registry, caller-selected route, or
completed future enters the producer.  The two low-universe spatial reads are
functions on the dependent blocked/restored occurrence domain.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace NoIslandNoMagic
namespace Consciousness
